    <md:content-id>m01705</md:content-id>
    <md:title>6.7.5: Practice</md:title>
    <md:uuid>c5e41279-8ba3-4aa9-9093-6bf0755be206</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.    </para>
<para>For questions 1 - 10, factor each of the expressions completely.</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="715ac5a8-aefe-4d4b-9b17-f9c908eca5a1"><problem><para>
      <para>\(36x^2y + 15xy − 6y\)</para>
      </para><para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\(3y(3x − 2)(4x + 1)\)</para><para>\(3y(3x − 2)(4x − 1)\)</para><para>\((3x + 2)(4x − 1)\)</para><para>\(3y(3x + 2)(4x − 1)\)</para></problem><solution><para>\(3y(3x + 2)(4x − 1)\)</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is \(3y(3x + 2)(4x − 1)\).
      </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
</document>
